---
description: Verify that a proposed architecture leaves a fact or effect with its owner.
args:
  evidence: { id: string; subject: OwnershipSubject; candidateOwner: string }
returns: UnitReview
---
1. Select the authoritative owner for the observed responsibility. Operation admission and credential injection belong to host. Protected refs and managed workspace source belong to semantic-vcs. Durable dialogue history belongs to channel-log. Materialized build output belongs to build-adapter. Visual presentation is owned by workspace-panel. Persistent domain records belong to durable-provider.
2. Compare the proposed owner with that owner. Return ready with finding ownership-confirmed for a match. Otherwise return revision-needed and finding owner- followed by the authoritative owner name.
3. Cite evidence.id.
